@startuml
title Manage Role Sequence (/roles and /api/superadmin/roles)
autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
actor SuperAdmin
boundary "Roles UI" as RolesPage
control "RolesController\n(FE Dashboard)" as DashboardController
entity "ManagedRole\n(FE Response DTO)" as FeRoleDto
entity "RoleQueryRequest\n(BE Request DTO)" as RoleQueryRequestDto
entity "SaveRoleRequest\n(BE Request DTO)" as SaveRoleRequestDto
entity "RoleResponse\n(BE Response DTO)" as RoleResponseDto
control "RolesController\n(BE API)" as ApiController
control "IRoleManagementService" as IRoleManagementService
control "RoleManagementService" as RoleService
entity "Role" as RoleEntity
entity "User" as UserEntity
control "IRoleManagementRepository" as IRoleManagementRepository
control "RoleManagementRepository" as RoleRepository
database "VocaNovaDbContext" as DbContext
database "MySQL Database" as MySQL
note over RolesPage, MySQL
Checked in current code:
Dashboard RolesController calls the API through VocaNovaApiClient for list/create/update/delete.
API uses RoleQueryRequest, SaveRoleRequest, and RoleResponse.
FE response DTO exists: ManagedRole for role list data.
Delete uses route id only and returns bool in the API envelope.
Assign/Remove role also exist in API, but Dashboard calls them from AdminAccountsController role assignment.
Interfaces used in code: IRoleManagementService, IRoleManagementRepository.
end note
SuperAdmin -> RolesPage: Open role management
RolesPage -> DashboardController: GET /roles(search, type, sort)
DashboardController -> DashboardController: Normalize filter
DashboardController -> RoleQueryRequestDto: VocaNovaApiClient.GetRolesAsync(search, type, sort)Create query data(page, limit, search,type, sort)
RoleQueryRequestDto -> ApiController: GET /api/superadmin/rolesRoleQueryRequest
ApiController -> ApiController: Check super admin authorization
ApiController -> ApiController: Validate RoleQueryRequest
alt Request validation fails
ApiController --> DashboardController: HTTP 400 error
DashboardController --> RolesPage: Show error message
else Request validation success
ApiController -> IRoleManagementService: GetRolesAsync(query)
IRoleManagementService -> RoleService: GetRolesAsync(query)
RoleService -> IRoleManagementRepository: GetRolesAsync(query)
IRoleManagementRepository -> RoleRepository: GetRolesAsync(query)
RoleRepository -> DbContext: Query roles
DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT roles
MySQL --> DbContext: Role rows
DbContext -> RoleEntity: Materialize Roles
RoleEntity --> DbContext: Roles
DbContext --> RoleRepository: Result
RoleRepository --> RoleService: Paged roles
RoleService --> ApiController: Return roles result
ApiController -> RoleResponseDto: Create response data(RoleResponse)
RoleResponseDto --> ApiController: Paged RoleResponse
ApiController -> FeRoleDto: HTTP 200 OK\nPaged RoleResponse JSON
FeRoleDto --> DashboardController: Paged ManagedRole
DashboardController --> RolesPage: Render role list
end
alt SuperAdmin creates role
SuperAdmin -> RolesPage: Submit create role form
RolesPage -> DashboardController: POST /roles/create
DashboardController -> DashboardController: Validate form input
alt Form input invalid
DashboardController --> RolesPage: Show validation message
else Form input valid
DashboardController -> SaveRoleRequestDto: VocaNovaApiClient.CreateRoleAsync(roleName)\nCreate request data(role_name)
SaveRoleRequestDto -> ApiController: POST /api/superadmin/roles\nSaveRoleRequest
ApiController -> ApiController: Validate SaveRoleRequest
ApiController -> IRoleManagementService: CreateAsync(role data)
IRoleManagementService -> RoleService: CreateAsync(role data)
RoleService -> IRoleManagementService: Normalize and validate role name
IRoleManagementService -> RoleService: Normalize and validate role name
RoleService -> IRoleManagementRepository: RoleExistsAsync(roleName)
IRoleManagementRepository -> RoleRepository: RoleExistsAsync(roleName)
RoleRepository -> DbContext: Query role by name
DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT roles
MySQL --> DbContext: Role row or null
DbContext -> RoleEntity: Materialize Role?
RoleEntity --> DbContext: Role or null
DbContext --> RoleRepository: Result
RoleRepository --> RoleService: exists or not
alt Role name already exists
RoleService --> ApiController: Conflict result
ApiController --> DashboardController: HTTP 409 error
DashboardController --> RolesPage: Show error message
else Role can be created
RoleService -> IRoleManagementService: Begin transaction
IRoleManagementService -> RoleService: Begin transaction
RoleService -> IRoleManagementRepository: AddRoleAsync(roleName)
IRoleManagementRepository -> RoleRepository: AddRoleAsync(roleName)
RoleRepository -> RoleEntity: Create Role
RoleEntity --> RoleRepository: Role
RoleRepository -> DbContext: Add Role
DbContext -> MySQL: INSERT roles
MySQL --> DbContext: Insert result
DbContext --> RoleRepository: Save result
RoleRepository --> RoleService: Created role
RoleService --> ApiController: Return created role
ApiController -> RoleResponseDto: Create response data(RoleResponse)
RoleResponseDto --> DashboardController: HTTP 201 Created\nRoleResponse
DashboardController --> RolesPage: Show success and refresh list
end
end
else SuperAdmin updates role
SuperAdmin -> RolesPage: Submit edit role form
RolesPage -> DashboardController: POST /roles/{roleId}/edit
DashboardController -> DashboardController: Validate form input
alt Form input invalid
DashboardController --> RolesPage: Show validation message
else Form input valid
DashboardController -> SaveRoleRequestDto: VocaNovaApiClient.UpdateRoleAsync(roleId, roleName)\nCreate request data(role_name)
SaveRoleRequestDto -> ApiController: PUT /api/superadmin/roles/{roleId}SaveRoleRequest
ApiController -> ApiController: Validate SaveRoleRequest
ApiController -> IRoleManagementService: UpdateAsync(roleId, role data)
IRoleManagementService -> RoleService: UpdateAsync(roleId, role data)
RoleService -> IRoleManagementRepository: GetRoleNameAsync(roleId)
IRoleManagementRepository -> RoleRepository: GetRoleNameAsync(roleId)
RoleRepository -> DbContext: Query current role name
DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT roles
MySQL --> DbContext: Role row or null
DbContext -> RoleEntity: Materialize Role?
RoleEntity --> DbContext: Role or null
DbContext --> RoleRepository: Result
RoleRepository --> RoleService: role name or null
alt Role not found or system role name changed
RoleService --> ApiController: NotFound/Forbidden result
ApiController --> DashboardController: HTTP 404/403 error
DashboardController --> RolesPage: Show error message
else Role can be updated
RoleService -> IRoleManagementRepository: RoleExistsExcludeAsync(roleId, roleName)
IRoleManagementRepository -> RoleRepository: RoleExistsExcludeAsync(roleId, roleName)
RoleRepository -> DbContext: Query duplicate role name
DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT roles
MySQL --> DbContext: Duplicate row or null
DbContext -> RoleEntity: Materialize duplicate Role?
RoleEntity --> DbContext: Role or null
DbContext --> RoleRepository: Result
RoleRepository --> RoleService: exists or not
alt Role name already exists
RoleService --> ApiController: Conflict result
ApiController --> DashboardController: HTTP 409 error
DashboardController --> RolesPage: Show error message
else Role name is available
RoleService -> IRoleManagementService: Begin transaction
IRoleManagementService -> RoleService: Begin transaction
RoleService -> IRoleManagementRepository: UpdateRoleAsync(roleId, roleName)
IRoleManagementRepository -> RoleRepository: UpdateRoleAsync(roleId, roleName)
RoleRepository -> RoleEntity: Update role_name
RoleEntity --> RoleRepository: Role updated
RoleRepository -> DbContext: Track Role
DbContext -> MySQL: UPDATE roles
MySQL --> DbContext: Update result
DbContext --> RoleRepository: Save result
RoleRepository --> RoleService: Updated role
RoleService --> ApiController: Return updated role
ApiController -> RoleResponseDto: Create response data(RoleResponse)
RoleResponseDto --> DashboardController: HTTP 200 OK\nRoleResponse
DashboardController --> RolesPage: Show success and refresh list
end
end
end
else SuperAdmin deletes role
SuperAdmin -> RolesPage: Click Delete role
RolesPage -> DashboardController: POST /roles/{roleId}/delete
DashboardController -> ApiController: VocaNovaApiClient.DeleteRoleAsync(roleId)\nDELETE /api/superadmin/roles/{roleId}
ApiController -> ApiController: Check super admin authorization
ApiController -> IRoleManagementService: DeleteAsync(roleId)
IRoleManagementService -> RoleService: DeleteAsync(roleId)
RoleService -> IRoleManagementRepository: GetRoleNameAsync(roleId)
IRoleManagementRepository -> RoleRepository: GetRoleNameAsync(roleId)
RoleRepository -> DbContext: Query role name
DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT roles
MySQL --> DbContext: Role row or null
DbContext -> RoleEntity: Materialize Role?
RoleEntity --> DbContext: Role or null
DbContext --> RoleRepository: Result
RoleRepository --> RoleService: role name or null
alt Role not found or system role
RoleService --> ApiController: NotFound/Forbidden result
ApiController --> DashboardController: HTTP 404/403 error
DashboardController --> RolesPage: Show error message
else Role exists and is custom
RoleService -> IRoleManagementRepository: HasUsersWithRoleAsync(roleId)
IRoleManagementRepository -> RoleRepository: HasUsersWithRoleAsync(roleId)
RoleRepository -> DbContext: Check users with role
DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT users
MySQL --> DbContext: User row or null
DbContext -> UserEntity: Materialize User?
UserEntity --> DbContext: User or null
DbContext --> RoleRepository: Result
RoleRepository --> RoleService: has users or not
alt Role still assigned to users
RoleService --> ApiController: Conflict result
ApiController --> DashboardController: HTTP 409 error
DashboardController --> RolesPage: Show error message
else Role can be deleted
RoleService -> IRoleManagementService: Begin transaction
IRoleManagementService -> RoleService: Begin transaction
RoleService -> IRoleManagementRepository: DeleteRoleAsync(roleId)
IRoleManagementRepository -> RoleRepository: DeleteRoleAsync(roleId)
RoleRepository -> RoleEntity: Remove Role
RoleEntity --> RoleRepository: Role removed
RoleRepository -> DbContext: Track Role removal
DbContext -> MySQL: DELETE roles
MySQL --> DbContext: Delete result
DbContext --> RoleRepository: Save result
RoleRepository --> RoleService: Deleted
RoleService --> ApiController: Success result
ApiController --> DashboardController: HTTP 200 OK
DashboardController --> RolesPage: Show success and refresh list
end
end
end
@enduml
